    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cikirok m'ongoye kony gi Misir",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ji ma jogwenyere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rwoth lamiyo ji pere silwany",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri, awi ji ma Zayon, ma jobedo i Yerusalem, wikilaywak kendo. Adieri Rwoth lanyutho win wor i derino ma ywak mewin, ka go owinji, go ladwoko win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makada nende Rwoth omiy win mugat ma litho gi pi makec, kucel kilakwanyo woko jofonjere mewin kendo, to waŋ win laneno jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka winowire racuc kosa racam, ithi win lawinjo wac yuŋey win ka waco ni, “Me a yo; woth win i iye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo wilakwanyo cal mewin m'oum gi feza kodi zahabu to wibolo woko paka oselo ma dhako oro ka ruko dwe, aka wilawaco ni, “Wikoci.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth lamiyo koth ri kodhi ma wicwoyo i lowo, kodi ŋano, aka cemo lanyak m'owega. I ndelo no ogwaŋe mewin jolabedo gi lum kweth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Megikwe gi punde ma jofuro ndelin mewin jolacamo cemo dhok ma di cumbi m'otiek piedho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malawin kodi waŋ pi jolakitula wok i wi kisi got kodi tendere, i ndelo ma thumirok madwoŋ ka acurcur opodhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dwe laliel paka waŋceŋ, aka waŋceŋ laliel dibirio loyo paka liel, paka ceŋ ma ndelo ario i ndelo acel, i ndelo ma Rwoth otwey to cango adhola m'omiyo ji pere gi goco pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Were lamiyo Asiria gir'acula",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilawero paka witimo wor ma kalima maleŋ, aka cuny win lakisangala paka ŋata wotho gi milowe ka kadho wi got pa Rwoth, Tele pa Isiraili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth lamiyo dwoŋ ma dwondi go wowinji, aka ilaneno cinge oloro ma goco, i nge mager kodi mac ma reyo woko jo, gi mwoc koth kodi cwe pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joasiria jolabwok ka jowinji dwondi Rwoth to joneno go ka gore gi luth pere ma nyweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi ka Rwoth sigila jo gi luth m'oyik, mor paka sasi gi tongol. Go lawito cinge lweny gi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole otiek yiko kama mac m'odheth lawaŋo kere ma Asiria cango con. Kanyago luth aka lac, aka ocan i iye yen. Rwoth laywe tome mac ma lacwinyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
